{"kind":"stack","id":"s1","title":"Classification keys: grouping living things","theme":{"background":"#f4f9ef","foreground":"#1f3a1f","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Classification key"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"A set of questions with yes or no answers that helps you name a living thing by its features."}],"actions":[],"buttons":[{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"Which of these is a living thing?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"A tree","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"A rock","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"A cloud","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Which feature do all living things need to grow and stay alive?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Food and water","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Batteries","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Sunlight only","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"A key asks: does it have a backbone? Which group does a fish belong to?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Animals with a backbone","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Animals without a backbone","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Plants","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"Habitat"},{"type":"text","id":"c5-e","content":"The place where a living thing lives and finds what it needs, such as a pond or a hedge."}],"actions":[],"buttons":[{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-q","content":"Which living thing would you most likely find in a pond?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"A frog","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"A camel","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-c","label":"A penguin","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-q","content":"You are a pupil on a nature walk. You find a small insect on a leaf. Do you use the key or ask a friend?"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a","label":"Use the key","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Ask a friend","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"You work through the key step by step and name the insect as a ladybird. Well done!"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-t","content":"Your friend guesses it is a beetle, but you are not sure. Using the key next time will help you check."},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"What is the first thing you should do when using a classification key?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"Look at the features of the living thing","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"Guess the name straight away","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"Pick the biggest group","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-t","content":"Well done! You finished the classification keys quiz."},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Keep looking closely at the living things around you. Every walk is a chance to use your key."}],"actions":[]}}
